   "source": [
    "## 指数积公式 (Product of Exponentials, PoE)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "405677cb",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**正运动学的一种建模方法，用一系列指数映射的乘积来表示机器人末端位姿。**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "poe-explanation",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "空间坐标系（Space Frame {s}）下的 PoE\n",
    "\n",
    "$$T(θ) = e^{[S_1]θ_1} \\cdots e^{[S_n]θ_n}M$$\n",
    "\n",
    "本体坐标系（Body Frame {b}）下的 PoE\n",
    "\n",
    "$$T(θ) = M e^{[B_1]θ_1} \\cdots e^{[B_n]θ_n}$$"
   ]
  },
  {
